---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How MANAV SOLS collects, uses, stores and protects information submitted through manavsols.com.">
  <section class="detail-page container legal-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-lead">Your privacy matters to MANAV SOLS. This policy explains what information may be collected through this website, how it is used, and the choices available to you.</p>

    <div class="legal-meta"><strong>Effective date:</strong> September 7, 2026</div>

    <div class="legal-content">
      <section>
        <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
        <p>MANAV SOLS is a technology-focused digital studio providing websites, software and digital solutions. For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:manav@manavsols.com">manav@manavsols.com</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
        <p>You can browse the public parts of this website without creating an account. When you submit a project request, we may collect the information you choose to provide, including:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your name and email address.</li>
          <li>Your mobile or WhatsApp number.</li>
          <li>The service, package or plan you are interested in.</li>
          <li>Your stated budget, current website URL and project requirements.</li>
          <li>Technical information that may be provided automatically by your browser or hosting infrastructure, such as IP address, device/browser details and request timing, where available to the services we use.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. How we use information</h2>
        <p>Information submitted through the project request system is used to review your requirement, communicate with you, manage the request, provide support, maintain business records and improve our services.</p>
        <p>We do not use submitted project information to send unrelated marketing unless you separately agree to receive it.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Project requests and email receipts</h2>
        <p>When you submit a project request, the information is sent to MANAV SOLS for handling. A tracking ID is generated for the request. Depending on system availability, a request receipt may also be emailed to you and a notification may be emailed to MANAV SOLS.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Service providers</h2>
        <p>MANAV SOLS may use third-party infrastructure and service providers to operate the website and request workflow. These may include hosting/deployment services, database services and email delivery providers. Those providers may process information as necessary to provide their services and are subject to their own terms and privacy policies.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
        <p>The website may use essential browser or hosting technologies needed to deliver and secure the service. We do not intentionally use the project request form to build advertising profiles about you.</p>
        <p>Where third-party services introduce cookies or similar technologies, their own policies and controls may also apply.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Data retention</h2>
        <p>We retain project and communication information for as long as reasonably necessary for business administration, ongoing support, legal obligations, dispute handling and record keeping. Retention periods may vary depending on the nature of the information.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. Security</h2>
        <p>We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure or destruction. No internet-based system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>9. Your choices and requests</h2>
        <p>You may contact us to ask what personal information we hold about you, request correction of inaccurate information, or ask for deletion where we are not required to retain it.</p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:manav@manavsols.com">manav@manavsols.com</a></p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>10. Children</h2>
        <p>This website is intended for general business and professional use. We do not knowingly request personal information from children for the purpose of providing services.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>11. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy when our website, services or legal obligations change. The latest version will be published on this page with its effective date.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-contact">
      <strong>Privacy questions?</strong>
      <p>Contact MANAV SOLS at <a href="mailto:manav@manavsols.com">manav@manavsols.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.legal-page{max-width:940px;padding-bottom:80px}.legal-lead{max-width:820px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:#c8d7e9;margin:0 0 18px}.legal-meta{display:inline-block;margin:10px 0 38px;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid rgba(25,191,255,.2);border-radius:10px;background:rgba(6,17,31,.65);color:#9fb4cc;font-size:13px}.legal-content{display:grid;gap:30px}.legal-content section{padding:26px 28px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(7,22,38,.84),rgba(3,9,17,.94))}.legal-content h2{margin:0 0 12px;color:#fff;font-size:22px}.legal-content p,.legal-content li{color:#b9c9db;line-height:1.75}.legal-content p{margin:0 0 12px}.legal-content p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.legal-content ul{margin:10px 0 0;padding-left:22px}.legal-content a,.legal-contact a{color:#19bfff}.legal-contact{margin-top:30px;padding:24px 28px;border:1px solid rgba(25,191,255,.28);border-radius:18px;background:rgba(25,191,255,.05)}.legal-contact strong{color:#fff}.legal-contact p{margin:8px 0 0;color:#b9c9db}@media(max-width:700px){.legal-page{padding-bottom:55px}.legal-lead{font-size:16px}.legal-content section{padding:20px}.legal-content h2{font-size:20px}.legal-contact{padding:20px}}
</style>
